      "statement": "set_new_client_admission_mode accepts only the mode from the caller, re-derives owner role from auth.uid(), returns ok, not_authorized, studio_not_found, invalid_mode or legacy_waitlist_cutover_required, and refuses to move an unstamped studio to open or closed until waitlist has been chosen once.",
